SS-LEMMA (Q12) pass lines, fixed 2026-11-16 BEFORE any script was run.

Lemma (as ss-second uses it, D = 4): for a source f (symmetric, divergence-free, smooth, compact support in the open
diamond) and every generator l = (1, n) of the cone from the tip, with complex null m tangent to the sphere at n,
  M_k(n) := int_0^1 u^k Psi_0[E f](u l) du = 0  for k = 0, 1, 2, 3,   Psi_0 = R(l, m, l, m).
(ss-second's M_n = int u^n j_F du, j_F = -2 u Psi_0, n = -1..2, is the same statement with n = k - 1.)

Notation: w = -l.y, mu = m.y, s = -y.y, v = mu l + w m, signature (-+++).

Script A  scripts\lemma_proof.py  (the hand proof's identities, exact symbolic)
 A1  epsilon-algebra, symbolic k: (k-1)(k-2) f_mm w^(1-k) + 2(k-2) d_eps[f(l_eps,m) w_eps^(1-k)] + d_eps^2[f(l_eps,l_eps) w_eps^(1-k)]
     at eps = 0 equals k(k-1) w^(-k-1) f(v,v).                          PASS iff residual simplifies to exactly 0.
 A2  sym-grad(xi2) = v v / w^3 and sym-grad(xi3) = s v v / w^4, all 10 components, symbolic y, at the canonical
     direction and at one generic rational direction.                   PASS iff all 40 residuals are exactly 0.
 A3  linearised Riemann of t_k = s^(k-2) w^(-k-1) v v: identically 0 for k = 2 and k = 3; NOT identically 0 for k = 4 (teeth).
     PASS iff exactly that.
 A4  D = 5 control (reduction): linearised Riemann of s^(k-5/2) w^(-k-1) v v non-zero at a rational point for k = 2 and k = 3.
     PASS iff both non-zero.
 A5  PLANT: xi3 with the coefficient 1/3 replaced by 1/2. PASS iff A2's test reports a non-zero residual (plant caught).

